      "en": "When Jehu had come to Jezreel, Jezebel heard of it; and she painted her eyes, and adorned her head, and looked out at the window.",
      "ko": "예후가 이스르엘에 이르니 이세벨이 듣고 눈을 그리고 머리를 꾸미고 창에서 바라보다가",
      "source_text_hash": "d5be5d0aa91e32ed9294d068f66ce1f2b4f8dffc186b96d7db72372b968ffa3d",
      "translation_text_hash": "d4c23065d835731b8a70621ac6a7c164e71072e3a4a21d5718ffe22f48dfe416",
