      "en": "He lifted up his face to the window, and said, “Who is on my side? Who?” Two or three eunuchs looked out at him.",
      "ko": "예후가 얼굴을 들어 창을 향하고 가로되 내 편이 될 자가 누구냐 누구냐 하니 두어 내시가 예후를 내다보는지라",
      "source_text_hash": "987fe2d779358a4ae5da1fcdad866b2d210064fe3c0df31ef7ae09ca27107be2",
      "translation_text_hash": "67d656786b234bb98b06c7c0f9e4bdc834641ac507960cc734cb8c86b415047f",
