        {
          "book": "2KI",
          "chapter": 9,
          "verse": 33
        }
      ],
      "en": "He said, “Throw her down!” So they threw her down; and some of her blood was sprinkled on the wall, and on the horses. Then he trampled her under foot.",
      "ko": "가로되 저를 내려던지라 하니 내려던지매 그 피가 담과 말에게 뛰더라 예후가 그 시체를 밟으니라",
      "source_text_hash": "8719041116a4b4fc95f04f32d4cc135caf756f55bfbe2ccdbea025d47350b14b",
      "translation_text_hash": "bbf31b275425ec48f5d3209e8ba85e0060b43c072fe7d9b2c32a664ec778dcc2",
