      "en": "When he had come in, he ate and drank. Then he said, “See now to this cursed woman, and bury her; for she is a king’s daughter.”",
      "ko": "예후가 들어가서 먹고 마시고 가로되 가서 이 저주 받은 계집을 찾아 장사하라 저는 왕의 딸이니라 하매",
      "source_text_hash": "482efb2ed559c589e536f955074f7cc0cce05263cd35d8229589afa845062342",
      "translation_text_hash": "257831ae2b276a79c794a1df9c29b53085f06d01a9055385ff53de76c5209bed",
