      "en": "They went to bury her, but they found no more of her than the skull, the feet, and the palms of her hands.",
      "ko": "가서 장사하려 한즉 그 두골과 발과 손바닥 외에는 찾지 못한지라",
      "source_text_hash": "716ade9bc1c5f0c5993da9f7d6d8690cecd5ed3be1f981db141870b12450b80d",
      "translation_text_hash": "ddaa8c1e8c62016ca211aa1be52e27e951165432957f96a72f0b11ffab8f8f80",
